cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite this repository and the source
  paper or papers relevant to the model components you use.
title: "Rendezvous and Reentry Mission Simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "GIacia"
    website: "https://github.com/GIacia"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GIacia/Rendezvous_and_Reentry"
url: "https://github.com/GIacia/Rendezvous_and_Reentry"
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB mission-level simulator for unmanned orbital rendezvous, de-orbit,
  and atmospheric re-entry, with standalone provenance-aware studies of
  selected Zhang and Saito paper models.
keywords:
  - rendezvous
  - re-entry
  - spacecraft
  - trajectory simulation
  - MATLAB
references:
