    volume: 77
    start: 11407
    end: 11417
    year: 2026
    doi: "10.1016/j.asr.2025.11.062"
  - type: article
    title: "Guidance strategies for controlled Earth reentry of small spacecraft in low Earth orbit"
    authors:
